# OpenModel — Select OpenCode Model

First, run this to show the current model:
```bash
cat {{AGENT_COLLAB_DIR}}/shared/opencode-model.txt 2>/dev/null || echo "(not set)"
```

Then ask the user which plan type they want to browse:

```
¿Qué tipo de modelos quieres usar?

  A)  OpenCode Go  — suscripción Go (sin costo por token)
  B)  Billing      — modelos de pago por API (tu propia key)

Escribe A o B:
```

