## Guardar selección

After the user picks a number, write the model ID:

```bash
echo "<model-id>" > {{AGENT_COLLAB_DIR}}/shared/opencode-model.txt
```

Then print: `[OPENCODE] Model set to: <display name>`

If the user passes a number/letter or model name as an argument, skip the menus and apply directly.
